      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:b0rcn8'
    '|a||$3: the harm of the last trip. More would price out trips worth making.':
